// # Strategic Front Door — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Point at the onboarding laws, spec sheet, vision docs, and RFCs. New agents start here.
//
// Setup: This file is the governance repo root. Resolve every beat
//        path from this file's directory. Do not prefix another
//        openOODA/ segment. Imports register the sibling docs.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Read rules.oot first — the 24 laws that govern your actions.
//   2. Read spec.oot second — the Tier A high-density language specification sheet.
//   3. Read northstar.oot third — the target architecture and non-normative vision.
//   4. Read requirements.oot fourth — the 10 strategic governance requirements.
//   5. Read rfcs/anchor.oo fifth — the 8 accepted RFCs.
//   6. Read practices/anchor.oo sixth — the evolving practices.
//   7. Read floor.oo seventh — the builder contract for raising the floor.
//   8. To propose a change, write a new RFC following rfcs/0000-template.oot.

